      benefit1Title: "Be among the first listed", benefit1Body: "Injishi opens district by district, Kigali first. Hosts verified now are the stays guests meet first, on a site where every listing has passed the same checks.",
      benefit2Title: "Keep the whole nightly rate", benefit2Body: "Injishi takes no commission from the host. The rate you set is the rate you are paid, released from escrow once your guest has checked in.",
      benefit3Title: "Start with the paperwork checked", benefit3Body: "Your RRA TIN and documents are checked when you register, and Injishi is being connected to the RRA's electronic billing so each booking can be declared under your own TIN.",
      step1Title: "Register your business", step1Body: "Your ID, your RRA TIN (or the UPI of a home you let), the address and your certificates. About ten minutes online, and the one-time registration fee is paid at the end.",
